# Layer 1 CI validator — PHP (opis/json-schema 2.6.0, пин D15) — P4.6, T-2

## p03-unevaluated (unevaluatedProperties) — bakeoff/probes/**
$ php bakeoff/php/validate-layer1.php bakeoff/probes/p03-unevaluated/schema.json bakeoff/probes/p03-unevaluated/valid.json
VALID
exit=0

$ php bakeoff/php/validate-layer1.php bakeoff/probes/p03-unevaluated/schema.json bakeoff/probes/p03-unevaluated/unknown-key.json
INVALID
keyword: unevaluatedProperties
  - Unevaluated object properties not allowed: x_unknown_probe_field
exit=1

## p06-if-then-else (dependentSchemas) — bakeoff/probes/**
$ php bakeoff/php/validate-layer1.php bakeoff/probes/p06-if-then-else/schema.json bakeoff/probes/p06-if-then-else/valid.json
VALID
exit=0

$ php bakeoff/php/validate-layer1.php bakeoff/probes/p06-if-then-else/schema.json <side_effect=write без approval>
INVALID
keyword: dependentSchemas
  - The object must match dependency schema defined on property 'side_effect'
  - The data is not valid on 'then' branch
  - The required properties (approval) are missing
exit=1

## audit-event.json (закрытая схема авторинга ревизии 2026-08, unevaluatedProperties на своём уровне поверх allOf-композиции с lifecycle-event.json)
$ php bakeoff/php/validate-layer1.php spec/revisions/2026-08/schema/authoring/audit-event.json <валидный документ>
VALID
exit=0

$ php bakeoff/php/validate-layer1.php spec/revisions/2026-08/schema/authoring/audit-event.json <тот же документ + x_unknown_probe_field>
INVALID
keyword: allOf
  - The data should match all schemas
  - The data must match $ref
  - Additional object properties are not allowed: x_unknown_probe_field
exit=1

## Замечание: dependentSchemas НЕ встречается ни в одной закрытой схеме авторинга ревизии 2026-08 (grep -rl dependentSchemas spec/ fixtures/ — пусто); энфорсмент подтверждён только корпусом bakeoff/probes/p06.
